invariant: INV-70
file: Makefile
catches: test/widemul-builds.sh
reason: make writes CH_P256_ARM64_MODEL for every host object, so
  p256_arm64_field.c would read test/p256_arm64_model.h, portable C in place
  of its two assembly routines, and every session of an arm64 object would
  run test code that no library build may hold. test/widemul-builds.sh
  refuses a host object's defines that name it.

--- old
             $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF))
--- new
             $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF) $(if $(CPU_RUNTIME_DEF),-DCH_P256_ARM64_MODEL))
